  _dialogueCollection:
  - HI!
  - "We need more people here in Aisle\u2019s 7 through 14."
  - "There\u2019s\u2026a lot of milk. "
  - "We\u2019re not sure where it\u2019s coming from, but we need to get it cleaned
    up...fast."
  - ...
  - "...Also, I\u2019m being told that our Meat deal is getting a whole lot meatier\u2026"
  - "We\u2019re extending the deal to include our Lamb products, as well as the beef.
    So, don\u2019t miss out..."
  - "...and please send help. \r\n"
